<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Southern yr shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>Southern yr shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended March 31</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 267.0    vs 216.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 178.0    vs 144.0</p>
<p>    Net premium income    4,094.0  vs 4,097.0</p>
<p>Net recurring premium 2,545.0  vs 2,365.0</p>
<p>    Investment revenue    2,017.0  vs 1,718.0</p>
<p>    Total income	    6,111.0  vs 5,815.0</p>
<p>    Attrib taxed surplus	497.0    vs 391.0</p>
<p>Div payable June 27</p>
<p>On register June 13</p>
<p>Full name: Southern Life Association Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
